# Simulator-only parameters (IF-21). Loaded after boaty-mk1.parm.
#
# SITL fakes the analogue battery inputs: pin 13/12 for BATT and pin 15 at a
# quarter of the pack voltage for BATT2, so the multipliers differ from the
# board. The boat physics supplies battery voltage and current over JSON.

BATT_VOLT_MULT      10.1
BATT_AMP_PERVLT     17
BATT2_VOLT_MULT     40.4    # 4 x 10.1: BATT2 reads the pack voltage (key in)

# The boat has ONE compass (KC-02 on the GNSS mast; the FC has none). SITL
# simulates three, and a healthy spare would hide single-compass faults (V-16).
COMPASS_USE2        0
COMPASS_USE3        0
